<title>USA: JW Charles Financial sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>JW Charles Financial sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>JW Charles Financial Services Inc said Monday its board of directors declared a three-for-two stock split in the form of a one-half share dividend per share of common stock.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed to shareholders of record on January 24, 1997, which is also the record date for the stock split.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be paid in cash, the company said.</p>
</text>
